              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inera kwanata Ejakait EDEKE ebe: Kapaaran kaŋin elomarete aomisio otaukon, ipwakuni ijo nukiswama nueroko: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.18.7+JDG.18.8+JDG.18.9+JDG.18.10+JDG.18.11+JDG.18.12+JDG.18.13+JDG.18.14+JDG.18.15+JDG.18.16+JDG.18.17+JDG.18.18+JDG.18.19+JDG.18.20+JDG.18.21+JDG.18.22+JDG.18.23+JDG.18.24+JDG.18.25+JDG.18.26+JDG.18.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tub 18:7-27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Itemari atiar, ‘Adokari kiton akwap naka ireria lumam ebwaitai; alosikini luijamamaete, luibojete iyamakina, kere luibojete komameete arwatatin, karaida atiketa ka irutei’: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aiŋat iŋatan ka amej imejan: ibelokini akonikan asurokin aiboisio nulem iswapito nuejaas ituŋa, ka asurokin ituŋa luetukokina anyoun katekerin, luadumunito ibaren ka iboro, luibojete kokidin kakwap. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.27.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Esk 27:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.19.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "19:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.19.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Seba ka Dedan, ka ikagwelanarak luka Tarusis, ka idwe luka iŋatunyo kere, kitemarete atiar, ‘Ibunit kereka ijo aiŋat iŋatan? Itukokinit kereka akonitukot amej imejan? Ayaŋaar epuesa ka esabu, alemar ibaren ka iboro, anatar iŋatuna luipu?’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
