        },
        {
          "text": "“Inera kwanata Ejakait EDEKE ebe: Ŋo kereka ŋol loenerenena eoŋ apeŋo kama kikabulesin inabin luka Isirael, luadwarenenete kapaarasia kakwa ikar luipu ebe kayauni jo asurokin kes? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
