            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Emaranete iboro lukecor lukaŋolol, ka akweny nuka apak, ka itian luka ais, ka iboro kere lueliatos kalup, ka ituŋa da kere lueiaas akwap, kanuka abunoreka, eukonorio ironan, ibirori neicelelei, ibironoros da arwatatin kere kwap. ",
          "type": "text",
